  m_text: "Instruction\n\n1. Your goal is to collect all items on the grocery list
    at the bottom of your screen. \n\n2. Talk to people in the store to get hints
    on what these items are.\n\n3. Once you think you have the right item, place
    it in the basket located next to the front door. \n\n4. If it is correct, the
    item number will lower, if it is incorrect, you lose a life.\nCollect everything
    before losing all your lives!"
